  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a National Strategy for the Development of Statistics in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to support  the National Statistical institute of the Republic of Albania (INSTAT) in : (i) preparinga new long-term National Strategy for the Development of Statistics for 2019-2030 (NSDS); (ii) preparing supplemental mid-term action plans; and (iii) conduct capacity building activities for INSTAT staff to support the implementation of these action plans.</narrative>
  </description>
